synopsis: Acquire/release semaphore tokens more readily
description:
  GHC now acquires semaphore tokens more readily, waiting on the semaphore for
  as many tokens as there are outstanding work items, instead of asking one
  token at a time.

  The release debounce period was also considerably shortened, from 1s to 10ms.
